[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":111},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-unicef-internship-program-2026-for-students-and-graduates-remote--299":3},{"news":4,"more":29},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":21,"notifiedBy":10,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":22,"categories":23,"readTime":28},299,"unicef-internship-program-2026-for-students-and-graduates-remote--299","Unicef Internship Program 2026 For Students And Graduates (remote)","\u003Cp>The UNICEF Internship Programme offers students and recent graduates from diverse academic backgrounds the opportunity to gain hands-on experience with UNICEF through global internship opportunities.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>UNICEF Internship Programs Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: UNICEF\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Online | Onsite\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category:  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Finternships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Internships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ftrainings\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Trainings\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Training\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Monthly Stipend\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Travel &amp; Visa Costs\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: Varies by Opportunity\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>UNICEF Internship Programs Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The UNICEF Internship Program offers a unique opportunity to gain international experience, develop professional skills, and contribute to meaningful work—all while earning a competitive stipend.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>This is an exciting opportunity to obtain an in-depth understanding of the functioning of UNICEF and its work, from high-level political engagement to liaising with colleagues in the field, at the country and regional level, and across headquarters divisions.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Interns at UNICEF get experiential learning opportunities in the humanitarian sector and a meaningful internship experience that will support their academic, professional and personal development.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>UNICEF Internship 2026 Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The UNICEF Internship Programme;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>offers students and recent graduates the opportunity to gain direct practical work experience.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>an internship is normally \u003Cstrong>between six and twenty-six weeks\u003C\u002Fstrong>. Internships can be on a full-time or part-time basis.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>UNICEF provides a monthly stipend to interns. A one-time lump sum, as a contribution towards travel and visa costs, may also be granted when funding is available.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>If necessary, UNICEF will provide relevant supporting documents for our visa applications.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>UNICEF Internship Program Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the UNICEF Internship Program, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be at least 18 years old.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be enrolled in an undergraduate, graduate, or PhD programme, or have graduated within the past two years.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be proficient in at least one of UNICEF’s working languages: English, French or Spanish. Fluency in the working language of the office you are applying to, may also be required.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have no immediate relatives (e.g., mother, father, sister, brother) working with UNICEF, or any other relatives in your reporting line of authority.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have strong academic performance and motivation.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Additional consideration will be given to any professional experience relevant to the function you’re applying for.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for UNICEF Internship Programs 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the UNICEF Internship Program, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click the button below to visit the UNICEF webpage.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Proceed to \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fjobs.unicef.org\u002Fen-us\u002Ffilter\u002F?search-keyword=&amp;work-type=internship&amp;_gl=1*16pp5gy*_gcl_au*MTQ4ODI5MzA2NC4xNzQ4ODU2NTI4*_ga*NjczMjY5NTYxLjE3NDg4NTY1Mjk.*_ga_P0DMSZ8KY6*czE3NDg4NTY1MjgkbzEkZzEkdDE3NDg4NTY1NzMkajE1JGwwJGgw*_ga_ZEPV2PX419*czE3NDg4NTY1MjgkbzEkZzAkdDE3NDg4NTY1MjgkajYwJGwwJGgw\">\u003Cstrong>find current opportunities on UNICEF’s vacancies page\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fa>.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Once you identify a vacancy of interest, please click on the button “Apply Now” and then proceed with the instructions for the application process. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Carefully review the requirements for each internship opportunity and customize your profile to highlight your suitability for the role.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Build a compelling profile and get your dream job \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.unicef.org\u002Fcareers\u002Fget-prepared-apply\">with these application and assessment tips\u003C\u002Fa>.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Due to the high number of applications, only shortlisted candidates will be contacted.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Apply here: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.unicef.org\u002Fcareers\u002Finternships\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww.unicef.org\u002Fcareers\u002Finternships\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-06-20 13:08:58",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Funicef-internship-program-2026-for-students-and-graduates-remote\u002F6a3682dacaea27.47125847_screenshot 2026-06-20 130232.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Funicef-internship-program-2026-for-students-and-graduates-remote\u002F6a3682dacaea27.47125847_screenshot%202026-06-20%20130232.png","2026-06-22 12:37:10","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[24],{"id":25,"name":26,"createdAt":27},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",3,[30,40,50,59,68,77,86,94,103],{"id":31,"slug":32,"title":33,"images":34,"datePosted":38,"authorName":39},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[35],{"fileName":36,"oldFileName":36,"type":18,"file":19,"url":37},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot%202026-06-24%20204255.png","2026-0